  m_text: "                            HOW TO PLAY\r\n\r\n\tThe storm is breaking
    through the window!\r\n\t\tYou have 40 seconds to board it up!\r\n\r\n\t\t1.
    Press [3] - Select PLANK\r\n   \t\tDrag the plank to the window zone\r\n\r\n\t\t2.
    Press [1] - Select NAIL\r\n  \t\t Drag the nail to the plank\r\n\r\n\t\t3. Press
    [2] - Select HAMMER\r\n   \t\tClick on the nail to hammer it in\r\n\r\n\tBoard
    up both planks before time runs out!\r\n\tYour health drains every second - hurry!\r\n"
